# Project-1

## Project Overview

A simple and responsive frontend website built with HTML5 and CSS3. This project focuses on creating a clean layout, responsive design, and a user-friendly web experience.

## Technologies Used

* HTML5
* CSS3

## Main Features

* Responsive web design
* Clean and simple user interface
* Structured HTML5 layout
* Custom CSS styling
* Mobile-friendly design

## Dependencies

This project does not require any external dependencies. It is built using HTML5 and CSS3.

## How to Run Locally

1. Clone the repository:

   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/ijannathalima-ux/project-1.git
   ```

2. Open the project folder.

3. Open `index.html` in your browser.

